bd-fleet-bench: 6-Platform Headless Persistent 20-Turn Fleet Benchmark & Telemetry Runner.
Runs parallel concurrent 20-turn sessions on: Claude, Codex, AGY Gemini, AGY Claude, Grok Build, Kimi Code.
Logs output, latency, and telemetry to Cockpit and disk.
"""

